#: search2:search2_3785C6ED_3C88_4502_9EEE_CA220C2BA32E
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: a115e547cad0449709bf84a755bfd7fe157db7bbf7a46ec577ea34f87f6fe955
