"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫My blood was for the sick and needy. ⟪k:2⟫I would never spare a drop for a murderer "
"like him.⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫⟪k:5⟫And I told the man exactly that, demanding he leave.⟪k:6⟫⟪k:7⟫⟪k:8⟫All I "
